{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":877648,\"title\":\"The Adventures of Timmy the Tooth: Molar Island\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Timmy dreams that he and Brushbrush win a dream vacation to Molar Island. Timmy ends up helping the locals when the ancient crown of King Cuspid has been stolen by the Gingivitis Tribe and the island will sink if the ancient crown of King Cuspid is not returned to the hole it was placed over.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/umw634hyf2WFeN41P7FnisgyXPv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":6.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":1995,\"runtime\":29,\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Music\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"James Murray\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":202446,\"name\":\"James Murray\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zzftfhnwepDC0y4HIOxmPap3Znh.jpg\"},{\"id\":1685453,\"name\":\"Greg Ballora\",\"character\":\"Emmett the Mailbox (voice)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1224515,\"name\":\"Bruce Lanoil\",\"character\":\"Sidney Cyclops (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sCo13VuuaW6Edb8C5LzRHGPlgXf.jpg\"},{\"id\":1211591,\"name\":\"Todd Mattox\",\"character\":\"Brushbrush (voice)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1229674,\"name\":\"Phil Baron\",\"character\":\"Leo (voice)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1893672,\"name\":\"Cheryl Blaylock\",\"character\":\"Bubbles Gum (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x0zF6JiCvDGiYt2DwoegeomKX7e.jpg\"},{\"id\":202446,\"name\":\"James Murray\",\"character\":\"Darol (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zzftfhnwepDC0y4HIOxmPap3Znh.jpg\"},{\"id\":2425870,\"name\":\"Christine Papalexis\",\"character\":\"Annette Bruner Prower (voice)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":97956,\"name\":\"Allan Trautman\",\"character\":\"Johnny Paste (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uBQwpq9z8lU8GOrHW0XxGxV4Sho.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":446893,\"title\":\"Trolls World Tour\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7W0G3YECgDAfnuiHG91r8WqgIOe.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qsxhnirlp7y4Ae9bd11oYJSX59j.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Queen Poppy and Branch make a surprising discovery — there are other Troll worlds beyond their own, and their distinct differences create big clashes between these various tribes. When a mysterious threat puts all of the Trolls across the land in danger, Poppy, Branch, and their band of friends must embark on an epic quest to create harmony among the feuding Trolls to unite them against certain doom.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":901362,\"title\":\"Trolls Band Together\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bkpPTZUdq31UGDovmszsg2CchiI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mDW6z7I6de6JbUgPOkAEZwKbg7G.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Branch's brother, Floyd, is kidnapped for his musical talents by a pair of nefarious pop-star villains, Branch and Poppy embark on a harrowing and emotional journey to reunite the other brothers and rescue Floyd from a fate even worse than pop-culture obscurity.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1243341,\"title\":\"Z-O-M-B-I-E-S 4: Dawn of the Vampires\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6rGsqBxI4r1YkS9FuraovWi465w.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/68TGPnvmZ21NBOoV5IUZ4fQDyvZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A new adventure dawns for Zed and Addison when their summer road trip takes an unexpected detour, landing them in the middle of yet another monster rivalry: Daywalkers vs. Vampires. Tensions flare when Zed and Addison find themselves acting as camp counselors between the two opposing supernatural factions. With the help of Eliza and Willa, they must convince sworn enemies Nova and Victor to try to unite their warring worlds before an even greater threat endangers them all.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":64328,\"title\":\"The Muppets\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h5N6x5gS45wAALt5fsWVn0oCYQR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/60PR4UC3D20dycVAoWadUzFio5R.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Kermit the Frog and the Muppets learn that their beloved theater is slated for demolition, a sympathetic human, Gary, and his felt-faced brother, Walter, swoop in to help the gang put on a telethon show and raise the $10 million they need to save the day.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12903,\"title\":\"Scooby-Doo! and the Goblin King\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jscb7MiWTYBjKlAb9TuNnFMSR81.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/llm8JA9OnDI29exEvBlriO5Lsjj.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Scooby-Doo and Shaggy must go into the underworld ruled by The Goblin King in order to stop a mortal named The Amazing Krudsky who wants power and is a threat to their pals: Fred, Velma, and Daphne.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":939210,\"title\":\"Blue's Big City Adventure\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sAYBC3WhhiX25629HLpCvkpGk9q.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/17sIiv4LGapYnyvdpKxA1vozBqY.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Josh gets the opportunity of a lifetime to audition for Rainbow Puppy’s Broadway musical, Josh and Blue skidoo to NYC for the very first time where they meet new friends and discover the magic of music, dance, and following one’s dreams.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Music\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":756403,\"title\":\"Riverdance: The Animated Adventure\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i6TRDlVuuEXMyLSlIkDd8YhBN0r.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qqthj8EUL4QKlDBoMcPqeWvi6Ya.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A young Irish boy named Keegan and Spanish girl named Moya journey into a magical world of the Megaloceros Giganteus who teach them to appreciate Riverdance as a celebration of life. Based on the stage show phenomenon of the same name and featuring Bill Whelan’s multi-platinum Grammy Award-winning music.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Fantasy\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":333667,\"title\":\"Rock Dog\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7RXi2afiNJGU8EB79SD8HYoSz4O.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vHiTIgoIoF1rjnjeC4n3qYaZ7Ua.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a radio falls from the sky into the hands of a wide-eyed Tibetan Mastiff, he leaves home to fulfill his dream of becoming a musician, setting into motion a series of completely unexpected events.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":15173,\"title\":\"Jonah: A VeggieTales Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xJ6ImpQIqZxBh4eE2813ljQ0TQ3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f02gitQgX3QocVeeqgak8U6LZB4.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Get ready as Bob the Tomato, Larry the Cucumber and the rest of the Veggies set sail on a whale of an adventure in Big Idea's first full-length, 3-D animated feature film. This is the story of Jonah and the Whale as you've never seen it before - a story where we learn that one of the best gifts you can give - or get - is a second chance.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":71571,\"title\":\"Totò Sapore and the Magical Story of Pizza\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sARJMq4T4ftHxr1oZOhUcbR0pEX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8LNd3dsgl0QyGpOKkwzj47y9Bhe.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Naples, 18th century. Salvatore \\\"Totò\\\" Sapore, an unemployed minstrel, always manages to cheer up the hungry with his songs about good food, always upsetting Vesuvia, a magma witch who lives inside the Vesuvius.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5172,\"title\":\"The Astronaut Farmer\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/19uGc8wW3Ert1QvMYxvnReQkFMc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l4hWbdxXompHvLIR0bl3m3WromI.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Texan Charles Farmer left the Air Force as a young man to save the family ranch when his dad died. Like most American ranchers, he owes his bank. Unlike most, he's an astrophysicist with a rocket in his barn - one he's built and wants to take into space. It's his dream. The FBI puts him under surveillance when he tries to buy rocket fuel, and the FAA stalls him when he files a flight plan – but Charles is undeterred.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8676,\"title\":\"Fool's Gold\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/f4djEBW3nyGRPLTcDlWYyaO43mx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6vsZR4066s6ZbaAAqDdzDbC4kgH.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Treasure hunter Ben \\\"Finn\\\" Finnegan has sunk his marriage to Tess and his trusty boat in his obsessive quest to find the legendary Queen's Dowry. When he finds a vital clue that may finally pinpoint the treasure's whereabouts, he drags Tess and her boss, billionaire Nigel Honeycutt, along on the hunt. But Finn is not the only one interested in the gold; his former mentor-turned-enemy Moe Fitch, hired by rapper-turned-gangster Bigg Bunny, will stop at nothing to beat him to it.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Romance\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"20B1OlLpY6o\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"XYFTc244tPA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"3Piv7kmYVlg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}